      "content": "but it isnt just about feelings. i actually sat down and did the math. if i keep working this job, i'm just losing money on gas and food and stuff we can't afford anyway. if i'm not around, the insurance payout and whatever they get from my death would actually cover the mortgage for a few years. it's like... the only way i can actually provide for them now is by not being a part of the equation anymore. it's the only thing that actually makes sense.",
